# Three players: Mardu Siegebreaker exiles Bot1's Ornithopter and attacks Bot2. "For each opponent" makes one tapped token copy
# of the Ornithopter attacking each opponent (CR 508.4, 707.2): one attacking Bot2 and one attacking Bot3, never declared as
# attackers. At the beginning of Bot1's next end step both tokens are sacrificed (CR 603.7c).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Mardu Siegebreaker
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mardu Siegebreaker.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass
Bot1.Target(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass
? Exile = Ornithopter
[T1 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Mardu Siegebreaker > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass
? Combat.Attackers = Mardu Siegebreaker > Bot2; Ornithopter > Bot2; Ornithopter > Bot3
[T1 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter = (absent)
Exile = Ornithopter
Bot2.Life = 16
Bot3.Life = 20
